      <rule id="DecisionRule_enfMarkNoticeOfEvictionServed">
        <description>canMarkNoticeOfEvictionServed is Yes only once the eviction is scheduled, the court has not dispensed with service and the notice is not yet served, which is exactly when this task is due. Rescheduling generates a new notice of eviction, so it raises the task again.</description>
